OL,5,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FA dangerous drunk driver leads
OL,7,     Ftraffic cops on a 20-minute chase
OL,8,     Fthrough busy areas, and a drunk
OL,9,     Fdriver dangerously weaves down a
OL,10,     Fbusy dual carriageway.
OL,11,G1300 Traffic Cops
OL,12,     FIn central Derbyshire, the Traffic
OL,13,     FCops are on the hunt for a car
OL,14,     Flinked to the theft of two
OL,15,     Fmotorbikes. After a 10-minute
OL,16,     Fsearch, officers spot the car.
OL,17,G1400 Police Interceptors
OL,18,     FArmed police respond to reports of
OL,19,     Fa fight involving machetes. Plus,
OL,20,     Fcops provide a dawn chorus (aka
OL,21,     Fraid).
