OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FThere's a shortage of staff in the
OL,7,     Fdepartment - but no let-up.
OL,8,     FPhilip's nose is bleeding
OL,9,     Funcontrollably. And former cancer
OL,10,     Fpatient Ruth suffers extreme
OL,11,     Fstomach pain.
OL,12,G2100 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,13,     FA man suffering a suspected
OL,14,     Fcardiac arrest collapses at the
OL,15,     Fwheel, crashing his car. And a
OL,16,     Fholiday ends abruptly when a man
OL,17,     Ftumbles out of the hot tub in a
OL,18,     Fremote log cabin.
